  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A cube of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;has point charges <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> located at each of its vertices except at the origin where the charge is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The electric field at the centre of cube is:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0159_5c2d009367eb.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 225px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
