      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
